{"overview":"Infinite Challenge has been reported as the first \"Real-Variety\" show in Korean television history. The program is largely unscripted, and follows a similar format of challenge-based Reality Television programs, familiar to the audiences in the West, but the challenges are often silly, absurd, or impossible to achieve, so the program takes on the aspect of a satirical comedy variety show, rather than a more standard reality or contest program. In order to achieve its comedic purposes its 6 hosts and staff continuously proclaim, the elements of this show are the 3-Ds, Dirty, Dangerous, and Difficult.","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"\"Muhann~ Dojeon!~~~\" (\"Infinite~ Challenge!~~~\") 👐","runtime":90,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":30,"y":2008,"poster":"/9nb6NQ44FfvLEoS1tChIkN12hEg.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":27,"y":2005,"poster":"/4Nn3JUVrB4O6Qqo5yze051OG07O.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":26,"y":2005,"poster":"/swZx9NztltaiPQutg0lzDnOk0y9.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":563,"y":2006,"poster":"/tYMiQJJLu7oHCreRNWWDhtLexFY.jpg"}],"episodes":616,"crew":["김태호","권석"],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"유재석","role":"Self","photo":"/1uktAM7R2Hgc3dynIXvzfACOmnW.jpg"},{"name":"박명수","role":"Self","photo":"/pYCikF57BmoIMqOYJZEqLpSSk0O.jpg"},{"name":"정준하","role":"Self","photo":"/fNcdFdfAQuQXVd6fBLwH1ijXwvs.jpg"},{"name":"하하","role":"Self","photo":"/i3vcj3GI3TCmDlnI3aLA7pWKIuN.jpg"},{"name":"양세형","role":"Self","photo":"/5KFgASri0lSN7P2J1BCZCnXOsbC.jpg"},{"name":"정형돈","role":"Self","photo":"/9L4RG3cujCgTHjtDhFAG88gZiOX.jpg"},{"name":"노홍철","role":"Self","photo":"/d0UQQd792Y75IRNYzwxcz8uvN4N.jpg"},{"name":"길","role":"Self","photo":"/tQ4E9MhTkPnsOnuAxD2TQWjrc5L.jpg"},{"name":"전진","role":"Self","photo":"/2SAUrURhLFJ9uWpLamcd8fLyra3.jpg"},{"name":"조세호","role":"Self","photo":"/byV2UFSUJg39LPJyOutL1z0v2HY.jpg"},{"name":"황광희","role":"Self","photo":"/573WnrjL7YlnR5WrUAdG8Jdzn42.jpg"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://w